  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESILAND Armenia Gender integration - AIR LIP Armenia Gender integration</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RESILAND J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsintegrering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;dinsats inom j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsintegrering till Projektet RESILAND (naturresurs- och skogsrestaurering)&quot; i Armenien f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja projektteamet med bl a integrering av j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsfr&#xe5;gorna samt RBM;. Ge Sida st&#xf6;d genom studie, analys och r&#xe5;dgivningen av b&#xe5;de, projektf&#xf6;rslag men &#xe4;ven under implementeringen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support from consultant on gender mainstreaming related to the project RESILAND (Natural Resources and Forest Restoration)&quot; in Armenia. Consultant  will support the project team with e.g. gender mainstreaming and RBM; Provide Sida with support through study, analysis and advice of both project proposals but also during implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
